### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Browse products and stock
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### Filter in-stock products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?inStock=true

### Search products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?q=keyboard

### View a product and its current stock
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/1

### Register a user (run once for this username)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "password": "a-strong-demo-password"
}

### Log in; copy the returned token into the Authorization headers below
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "password": "a-strong-demo-password"
}

### Create an order. Replace <TOKEN> with your token and use a new Idempotency-Key for a new order.
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-2026-01

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Repeat the exact same request with the SAME key: it must return the original order and not reduce stock again.
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-2026-01

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}

### View your orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### View one of your orders (replace <ORDER_ID>)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/<ORDER_ID>
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Log out
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
